{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013WTL6d2ntEsnXp72TVUpUc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 schema-dag-extraction 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (14 个)\\n\\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd_r2**: RUNNING — \\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp007_error_taxonomy**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_v2_fewnerd**: PREPARING — \\n- **exp_fewrel_formal**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd_r2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **fewrel_pilot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp004_maven_bcs**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp002_confusability_controlled**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-004**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_count_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp012_llama_fewnerd_r2 | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp008_sdgd_v2_fewnerd（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd** (failed): —\\n- **exp007_error_taxonomy** (success): —\\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 8 / 负向 2 / 失败 2 / 共 12\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-38874: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp012_llama_fewnerd: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01McSQGkja8PgipZqGC6MdqF","session_id":"08464124-1424-4e01-848b-117232553f88","uuid":"3fc4cb3e-cc44-4377-b85e-369a996ce54d","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:38:32.925Z"}
