{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RDFHNTbk2bEG9eXoCFitgU","type":"tool_result","content":"experiment_plan.yaml:61:  description: 'DocRED confusability study: count curve + BCS correlation on DocRED\nROADMAP.md:45:- P1 候选: exp-005 (DocRED), exp-006 (interaction), exp-015 (SCS validation)\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:29:**10 天的时间约束下，8h 是可承受的。** 实验计划中 exp-005 (DocRED) 已被规划为 P1，只需将其提升为 P0。\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:36:| **DocRED** | 96 | **Yes** (GitHub + HuggingFace) | 5K docs | **次优** | 文档级 RE 增加 pipeline 复杂度；但 96 types 充足 |\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:43:- DocRED: [GitHub](https://github.com/thunlp/DocRED) / [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/datasets/thunlp/docred)\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:50:1. **FewRel (100 types) > DocRED (96 types)** 在本项目场景下更优：\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:56:2. **DocRED 作为备选**但有额外复杂度：\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:58:   - 实验计划中 exp-005 已规划了 DocRED，可保持不变作为 P1 补充\nartifacts/third_task_type_eval.md:74:将 FewRel 实验插入为 **exp-005b**（P0），与原 exp-005 (DocRED, P1) 并行规划。优先完成 FewRel，DocRED 视剩余时间决定。\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:9:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:22:3. Eval: ACE05, SciERC, TACRED/TACREV, DocRED, MAVEN, Few-NERD, WikiEvents, RAMS.\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:66:**Grounding approaches.** AEVS (MDPI Computers, March 2026) discovers text-grounded anchors for KG triplet extraction with near-zero hallucination (0.23-0.44% with Claude 4.5 Haiku, 0.828 Exact F1 on WebNLG). Entity type constraints in trained models — SH-ETRs (Expert Systems 2025, 74.39 F1 on DocRED), ETCGN (IJMLC 2024), Document-level RE with Entity Type Constraints (Neural Networks 2025) — embed type-compatibility filtering in learned parameters.\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:80:**Absolute performance context.** Training-free zero-shot LLM methods achieve ~35 F1 on ACE05 RE (vs. ~71 supervised ITER), ~18 F1 on Re-DocRED (vs. ~81 supervised DREEAM), ~14 F1 on ACE05 EE (vs. ~72 supervised). SDGD targets meaningful gains within the training-free regime where absolute performance matters for specific deployment scenarios.\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:160:**Day 4-8: SDGD Implementation + Core Experiments.** SCG construction, batch composition, selective grounding. Run SDGD-zero and SDGD-cal on 3 core benchmarks (ACE05, Few-NERD, DocRED).\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:174:**Evaluation.** 5 core benchmarks: ACE05 (joint NER/RE/EE, 58 types — full 3-layer DAG), SciERC (NER/RE, 13 types — simple schema control), MAVEN (168 event types — scaling stress test), DocRED (96 relation types — selective grounding stress test), Few-NERD (66 fine-grained entity types — confusability stress test).\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:180:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/IDEA_BRIEF.md:215:- DREEAM: Document-level RE with Evidence-guided Attention Mechanism (EACL 2023) — supervised Re-DocRED upper bound (~81.4 F1)\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:29:**10 天的时间约束下，8h 是可承受的。** 实验计划中 exp-005 (DocRED) 已被规划为 P1，只需将其提升为 P0。\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:36:| **DocRED** | 96 | **Yes** (GitHub + HuggingFace) | 5K docs | **次优** | 文档级 RE 增加 pipeline 复杂度；但 96 types 充足 |\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:43:- DocRED: [GitHub](https://github.com/thunlp/DocRED) / [HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/datasets/thunlp/docred)\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:50:1. **FewRel (100 types) > DocRED (96 types)** 在本项目场景下更优：\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:56:2. **DocRED 作为备选**但有额外复杂度：\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:58:   - 实验计划中 exp-005 已规划了 DocRED，可保持不变作为 P1 补充\nartifacts/_project/report/third_task_type_eval.md:74:将 FewRel 实验插入为 **exp-005b**（P0），与原 exp-005 (DocRED, P1) 并行规划。优先完成 FewRel，DocRED 视剩余时间决定。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:171:- name: DocRED Confusability Study\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:173:  description: '在 DocRED 96 关系类型上进行 count curve + pairwise SCS→confusion 分析。 文档级 RE\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:201:  result_rationale: 'DocRED 关系类型语义分布介于 Few-NERD（跨域）和 MAVEN（同域）之间—— 96 个关系覆盖多个领域但部分关系高度相似（如\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:204:    DocRED 跨域程度足够避免 MAVEN 的 centrality confound。 Extreme batch delta 较小（8.3pp vs Few-NERD\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:209:  - title: DocRED Pairwise Comparison Across Embeddings\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T113743/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:225:  - 'Fig: DocRED count curve — F1 单调递减，与 Few-NERD 方向一致'\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 30]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QXRrq61ytHCNXeWfzB2Uc5","session_id":"08464124-1424-4e01-848b-117232553f88","uuid":"9672cc28-110b-44da-a9f6-99ad3f3e5a8c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:38:54.143Z"}
